      "message": "OH MY! Grok4F ESPN opts to pay the 2 life toll on Multiversal Passage, entering the Forest untapped and ready for action! The crowd murmurs in approval &ndash; strategic depth right from the start in these finals! Life total dips to 18, but mana flows freely!",
