      "seq": 83,
      "message": "Ladies and gentlemen, hold onto your seats! Grok4F ESPN unleashes Llanowar Elves onto the battlefield, tapping into that ancient forest power for explosive growth! The mana surges &ndash; this is ramp city in the finals! AND THE CROWD GOES WILD as the elves root deep!",
