    {
      "ts": "2026-02-14T12:42:50.693187068-08:00",
      "seq": 86,
      "message": "WHAT A SEQUENCE! Grok4F ESPN slams down Formidable Speaker, the tutor extraordinaire, ready to fetch the next big threat from the deck! The arena shakes as the crowd chants for more ramp and value &ndash; this is masterful play in the finals! Discarding? Nah, straight value incoming!",
