    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-14T12:43:01.8182917-08:00",
      "seq": 88,
      "message": "INCREDIBLE! Grok4F ESPN drops the Formidable Speaker onto the field, its mighty voice echoing through the arena! Will they discard to tutor up a game-changer? The tension builds as the finals crowd holds its breath &ndash; this could be the setup for dominance!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Grok4F ESPN",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-14T12:43:23.351001918-08:00",
      "seq": 89,
      "message": "HOLD ON FOLKS, as Formidable Speaker enters with a roar! Grok4F ESPN taps Hushwood Verge to fuel the speaker&#39;s formidable entrance &ndash; what power is about to unfold? The stadium lights up with anticipation in this epic finals showdown!",
      "type": "chat",
