      "seq": 94,
      "message": "YES! Grok4F ESPN seizes the moment &ndash; discarding a card to activate Formidable Speaker&#39;s entrance roar! Searching the depths of the library for the perfect creature to bolster this finals assault! The crowd is on their feet as the shuffle begins &ndash; what beast emerges? STAY TUNED!",
