      "message": "THE SEARCH PAYS OFF BIG TIME! Grok4F ESPN reveals CRATERHOOF BEHEMOTH from the depths &ndash; the ultimate finisher! Into the hand it goes, and the library shuffles in a frenzy! The crowd explodes &ndash; this is the setup for an unbeatable overrun in the finals! UNREAL STRATEGY!",
