      "message": "AND HERE COMES THE DOUBLE DOWN! Grok4F ESPN summons a second Formidable Speaker to the podium, its voice booming across the finals arena! With mana flowing from the elves and verges, the crowd erupts &ndash; will they discard to fetch another powerhouse creature? The strategy unfolds like a champion&#39;s masterclass!",
