      "seq": 132,
      "message": "The echoes of the second Formidable Speaker fade into the arena&#39;s roar! Grok4F ESPN, with the board fortified and threats looming in hand, passes priority once more &ndash; letting the opponent&#39;s side of the finals take the spotlight. The crowd leans in; this turn-one setup is legendary &ndash; can Johnny counter the momentum?",
